---
// Shared font loading for every page: Geist + Geist Mono (DESIGN.md) and Material Symbols.
// Icons use display=block so ligature names never flash as raw text before the font arrives.
---

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..24,400,0..1,0&display=block" rel="stylesheet" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#fafafa" />
